    "|Use the following information: \nErero's Trading Account for the month ended 31/05/2001:\nOpening stock ... ₦45,000\nPurchases ₦110,000 less returns ₦6,000 ... ₦104,000\n(Opening stock + net purchases ... ₦149,000)\nLess closing stock ... ???\nCost of sales ... ???\nGross profit ... ???\nTotal ... ₦157,000\nSales ₦161,000 less returns ₦4,000 ... ₦157,000\nThe gross profit ratio for the company is 25%.\n\nIf the total expenses is ₦20,845, what will be the net profit for the company during the month?|₦19,149|₦16,168|₦21,655|₦18,405": "final-accounts",
