    "|Use the following information: \nAdex Ltd issues stock to its retail branch at cost price. The following particulars relate to Ede branch:\nStock at branch 1st January at cost ... ₦400\nGoods sent to branch at cost ... ₦8,000\nReturns to head office ... ₦340\nCash sales ... ₦9,160\nStock at branch 31st December at cost ... ₦720\n\nWhat is the gross profit carried to the profit and loss account?|₦1,820|₦1,640|₦1,530|₦1,870": "branch-accounts",
